	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『ドラゴンボールZ』より悟空の父親バーダックがプラモデル化！",
			"• 頬の十字傷や険しい表情など、バーダックのもつ魅力を細部まで再現。",
			"• 筋肉パーツを造形と分割で再現するマッスルビルドシステム搭載！",
			"• 高い可動域と付属のエフェクトパーツにより、名シーンや必殺技ポーズなどを再現できる。",
			"• クリアパーツを使用したエフェクトは、放出状態と溜め状態を再現。",
			"• 表情パーツは「通常」と「叫び」の２種付属。",
			"• ハンドパーツは左右とも握りと開手の２種ずつ付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Goku's father Bardock from \"Dragon Ball Z\" is now a plastic model!",
			"• Bardock's charm is recreated in detail, including the cross scar on his cheek and his rugged expression.",
			"• Equipped with a muscle build system that reproduces muscle parts by modeling and dividing!",
			"• With a high range of motion and included effect parts, you can recreate famous scenes and special move poses.",
			"• Effects using clear parts reproduce the release and storage states.",
			"• Two types of facial expression parts are included: \"normal\" and \"screaming\".",
			"• Two types of hand parts are included, one for the left and one for the left and the right!"
		]
	},
